# Secrets & env (any depth). No bare **/.env.* — keeps .env.example / .env.sample in context.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.production
**/.env.test
**/.env.staging
**/.envrc

# Common credential files
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa
**/*.key

# Safe templates — keep visible
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
